<p>Russia and Ukraine accused each other of violating a short Orthodox Easter ceasefire almost as soon as it began, quickly dimming hopes that the holiday pause might help wider peace efforts. The Kremlin said the truce would last 32 hours, from Saturday afternoon through the end of Sunday, but residents and officials on both sides showed little faith that it would hold. One concrete humanitarian step did move forward: the two sides exchanged 175 prisoners of war each, a rare example of limited cooperation during the broader war.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/fe4E4LdLFF-eThV95rAf5wZxY1LDfpHjMoFh2EF0ACZ7iMmhTgnV2G6936rXjOpfoOKwnsdJ_A2I-3I6Rn6sY-viD94OF0SDJa8_OQslmdlY' alt='A woman wipes her eyes as she stands amongst a group holding photographs of their missing or captured relatives and friends at a prisoner exchange in the Chernihiv region.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Border injuries: In Russia&#x27;s Kursk region, Governor Alexander Khinshtein said a Ukrainian drone struck a gas station in Lgov, injuring three people, including a baby.</li><li>Battlefield tempo: Ukraine&#x27;s military said Saturday still saw 57 air strikes, 182 guided aerial bombs, 3,928 drones, and 2,454 shelling attacks, suggesting the truce had little real effect on the pace of combat.</li><li>Longer pause: President Volodymyr Zelensky said Kyiv had proposed extending the ceasefire, arguing that any Russian refusal would show who &#x27;chooses war instead of peace&#x27;.</li><li>Pre-truce strike: Before the ceasefire began, Ukraine struck a Russian oil pumping station, according to Straits Times&#x27; report on regional officials and the lull that followed.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Ukrainian frontline officer: Serhii Kolesnychenko, a communications officer for the 148th Separate Artillery Brigade, said Russian forces kept striking Ukrainian positions with drones after the ceasefire took effect and said Russia was not observing the pause. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/11/russian-drone-attacks-persist-despite-kremlins-easter-ceasefire-ukrainian-forces-say'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Russian regional officials: Authorities in border regions said attacks on Russian territory also continued during the ceasefire window, showing that Moscow&#x27;s local officials were judging the truce through incidents in places such as Kursk and Belgorod, not only along the main front. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/russian-regional-officials-say-ukraine-attacked-kursk-belgorod-regions'>The Straits Times</a>)</li><li>Kharkiv residents: Residents interviewed in Kharkiv said the short truce offered little reassurance because they expected fighting to resume quickly and felt a brief pause could not bring back normal Easter observances. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cj0vn30574no'>BBC</a>)</li><li>Diplomatic backdrop: The Easter ceasefire came as US-led negotiations on a broader settlement had stalled, making even this brief pause a closely watched test of whether any confidence-building step between the two sides was still possible. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/russia-ukraine-accuse-each-other-of-violating-orthodox-easter-ceasefire'>The Straits Times</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/russia-ukraine-accuse-each-other-of-violating-orthodox-easter-ceasefire'>Russia, Ukraine accuse each other of violating Orthodox Easter ceasefire</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/11/russian-drone-attacks-persist-despite-kremlins-easter-ceasefire-ukrainian-forces-say'>Russian drone attacks persist despite Kremlin’s Easter ceasefire, Ukrainian forces say</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cj0vn30574no'>&#x27;We need real peace&#x27;: Easter truce fails to lift grim mood in war-torn Ukraine</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1990909/easter-truce-between-russia-and-ukraine-falters'>Easter truce between Russia and Ukraine falters</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/orthodox-easter-ceasefire-falters-as-ukraine-says-russia-continues-drone-strikes'>Orthodox Easter ceasefire falters as Ukraine says Russia continues drone strikes</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/easter-truce-between-russia-and-ukraine-falters-11344913#publisher=newsstand'>Easter Truce Between Russia And Ukraine Falters</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/04/12/easter-truce-between-russia-and-ukraine-falters-as-kyiv-records-469-violations_6752325_4.html'>Easter truce between Russia and Ukraine falters as Kyiv records &quot;469 violations&quot;</a> - lemonde.fr</li></ul>